{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19987","headline":"生生亭 · 孟郊","name":"生生亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"滩闹不妨语，跨溪仍置亭。\n置亭嵽嵲头，开窗纳遥青。\n遥青新画出，三十六扇屏。\n褭褭立平地，棱棱浮高冥。\n一日数开扉，仙闪目不停。\n徒夸远方岫，曷若中峰灵。\n拔意千余丈，浩言永堪铭。\n浩言无媿同，媿同忍丑醒。\n致之未有力，力在君子听。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19987.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19987","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}